managed used chezmoi

- install oh-my-zsh:
    sh -c "$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ohmyzsh/ohmyzsh/master/tools/install.sh)"
- install chezmoi:
    sh -c "$(curl -fsLS get.chezmoi.io)" -- init --apply git@github.com:pmaciocia/.dotfiles.git


references: 

    - https://www.drupaldump.com/right-way-migrate-your-bashprofile-zsh
    - https://www.chezmoi.io/quick-start/    
    - https://dev.to/andrenbrandao/terminal-setup-with-zsh-tmux-dracula-theme-48lm
    - https://github.com/romkatv/powerlevel10k

to fix jetbrains fonts:

- install fonts from p10k 
- settings > color scheme > console font
- use console font
- select MesloLGS NF

